1
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,150
Who are you?

2
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:41,280
W-What are you doing? Stop hitting me.

3
00:00:42,710 --> 00:00:43,640
Stop hitting me.

4
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:45,960
You again.

5
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:48,280
I haven't acted in ages.

6
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,840
Why are you still stalking me every day?

7
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,840
Wen Jianan, I'm a long-time fan of yours.

8
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,790
I like you.

9
00:00:52,790 --> 00:00:54,170
Stalker fans aren't real fans.

10
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:54,810
Get lost.

11
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:56,890
Get lost, or I'll beat you up.

12
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:57,960
Get lost, get lost!

13
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,080
And why are you following me?

14
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,260
I knew something was off about you
that day at the store.

15
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:17,710
I'm also your fan.

16
00:01:21,270 --> 00:01:23,670
Don't tell me you like me too.

17
00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:26,980
Yes.

18
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:32,860
[Dearest: Episode 21]

19
00:01:32,150 --> 00:01:33,350
I've liked you

20
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:37,520
for a very long time.

21
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:47,880
Then let's meet in the sunlight next time,

22
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:49,150
pretty fan.

23
00:01:52,170 --> 00:01:54,030
Your sister's new friend, Kelly,

24
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:55,870
has been making
multiple secret financial transactions

25
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:57,440
with an underground chemical lab
in Eastern Europe.

26
00:01:57,440 --> 00:01:58,729
Also, there is something off

27
00:01:58,729 --> 00:02:00,420
about your sister's condition.

28
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,250
Be careful.

29
00:02:14,290 --> 00:02:16,190
This is the first-month performance

30
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:17,920
of our Rejuvenation Capsules.

31
00:02:18,270 --> 00:02:20,829
Sales reached 300% of our target.

32
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,670
The high-end line has completely sold out,

33
00:02:23,670 --> 00:02:25,780
while customer satisfaction
and repurchase rates

34
00:02:25,780 --> 00:02:27,900
have reached an astonishing 95%.

35
00:02:28,070 --> 00:02:31,030
Ms. Wen, this product is an instant hit.

36
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:32,680
We couldn't have done it without you.

37
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,010
Yes.

38
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:36,520
It seems Wen Group about to
build a new empire

39
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:38,470
in the beauty and wellness industry.

40
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:40,000
This is just the beginning.

41
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,240
We have already received

42
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,730
cooperation invitations
from multiple international buyers.

43
00:02:43,730 --> 00:02:45,400
Ms. Wen, sorry to interrupt.

44
00:02:46,070 --> 00:02:49,110
Are there any potential risks
with this new product?

45
00:02:52,270 --> 00:02:54,150
I can assure everyone here

46
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:57,150
that I have personally tested it
for a long time.

47
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,750
There will be no side effects

48
00:02:58,850 --> 00:03:00,110
or adverse reactions.

49
00:03:01,020 --> 00:03:02,580
Please believe me.

50
00:03:03,070 --> 00:03:05,130
Our Rejuvenation Capsules
only gets better with time.

51
00:03:05,130 --> 00:03:06,740
Good.

52
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:08,070
Meeting adjourned.

53
00:03:15,550 --> 00:03:16,070
Jianan.

54
00:03:17,350 --> 00:03:17,920
Look.

55
00:03:18,540 --> 00:03:20,660
Kelly just messaged me.

56
00:03:20,950 --> 00:03:22,520
A top European salon wants to discuss

57
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,920
an exclusive distribution rights with us.

58
00:03:26,450 --> 00:03:28,770
How do you feel after using this medicine?

59
00:03:28,770 --> 00:03:31,610
Any discomfort

60
00:03:31,670 --> 00:03:34,950
like heart palpitations, hand trembling,

61
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:36,190
or...

62
00:03:37,670 --> 00:03:39,350
a strong craving for it?

63
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:41,700
No.

64
00:03:42,550 --> 00:03:44,079
What are you talking about?

65
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,360
I feel great.

66
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,200
My skin looks better,

67
00:03:47,810 --> 00:03:49,470
and I feel more energetic too.

68
00:03:51,010 --> 00:03:51,740
That's good.

69
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:55,700
It's just that we need to be cautious
with any new product.

70
00:03:56,010 --> 00:03:58,010
You're overthinking it. It's fine.

71
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,360
Okay.

72
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:21,640
The test results are in.

73
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:26,630
It's not any known illicit drug.

74
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:27,500
Look.

75
00:04:28,490 --> 00:04:30,950
It can modify the brain's neural receptors.

76
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:33,050
In the short term, it can produce

77
00:04:33,050 --> 00:04:35,200
feelings of euphoria and excitement.

78
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,560
But in the long run,

79
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:39,690
it can lead to severe dependence,
personality changes,

80
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,650
and eventually
a complete mental breakdown.

81
00:04:44,010 --> 00:04:46,080
This drug is incredibly sophisticated.

82
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:48,310
Standard drug tests can't detect it.

83
00:04:48,340 --> 00:04:51,320
It's more like a custom-made drug

84
00:04:51,350 --> 00:04:53,170
designed for high-net-worth individuals.

85
00:04:53,170 --> 00:04:54,630
Did you find out who did it?

86
00:04:54,990 --> 00:04:56,190
An old friend of ours.

87
00:04:58,430 --> 00:04:59,510
He Mu.

88
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,060
He broke out of prison.

89
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:18,530
I... I'm just here to change the dressing.

90
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,390
You scared me.

91
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,560
I remember now.

92
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,440
Back at the nursing home,

93
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,120
He Mu sent her to kill me.

94
00:05:25,460 --> 00:05:26,990
This person works for He Mu.

95
00:05:27,670 --> 00:05:29,800
She has done a lot of dirty work for him.

96
00:05:30,340 --> 00:05:31,460
But I never thought

97
00:05:31,860 --> 00:05:33,980
she would come after you this soon.

98
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:39,000
So they created the Rejuvenation Capsules

99
00:05:39,530 --> 00:05:41,650
and injected a new drug into them.

100
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,040
They don't just want to destroy Wen Group,

101
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:46,900
but also to turn
the most powerful women in Xinggang

102
00:05:46,930 --> 00:05:48,730
into drug-controlled puppets.

103
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,600
Then Wen Xin...

104
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,510
That's exactly what I wanted to tell you.

105
00:05:53,510 --> 00:05:55,680
We have to wait for the test results.

106
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,070
And we still haven't

107
00:05:58,070 --> 00:05:59,930
uncovered his entire operation.

108
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,880
If you tell Wen Xin now,

109
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:04,060
she may not even feel the effects

110
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:05,690
when the addiction first kicks in.

111
00:06:05,690 --> 00:06:07,210
She won't believe you,

112
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:09,440
and you will just tip the enemy off.

113
00:06:13,860 --> 00:06:15,400
Keep a close eye on the production line

114
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,570
and that Kelly.

115
00:06:17,070 --> 00:06:19,740
I'll handle Wen Xin.

116
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:23,630
This time, we must take down He Mu

117
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:28,320
when he is at the height of his success,

118
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:31,290
and wipe out his entire operation
along with him.

119
00:06:31,450 --> 00:06:32,750
What are you going to do?

120
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:34,810
We will turn his own scheme against him.

121
00:06:34,810 --> 00:06:37,370
Let him think we've completely swallowed

122
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,610
his sugar-coated bullets.

123
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,600
Send a message to Uncle Long.

124
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,140
It's time to close the net.

125
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:02,360
Have him get the acquisition funds ready

126
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,360
and prepare to move forward with the deal.

127
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:07,160
Godfather,
do we really have to rely on Uncle Long?

128
00:07:07,850 --> 00:07:09,610
He's too domineering.

129
00:07:09,630 --> 00:07:12,560
I'm afraid he won't be willing to
give up power later.

130
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:15,100
If you want to rise again,

131
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,820
you have to be willing to
share the profit.

132
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:19,460
But whatever I give away,

133
00:07:19,490 --> 00:07:21,440
I will get back sooner or later.

134
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:25,430
Uncle Long has men, power, and influence.

135
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:29,720
But I'm the only one
who understands Wen Group.

136
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,560
Now that Wen Group has hit rock bottom.

137
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,510
Without me,

138
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:35,920
all he'll get is an empty shell.

139
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:39,800
In the end, he will have no choice

140
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,920
but to put me in charge of Wen Group.

141
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:45,440
Wen Group will eventually be mine.

142
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,360
I never expected

143
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,680
what Yuqing left me

144
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,800
to be this useful.

145
00:07:55,730 --> 00:08:00,290
Just a slight change
to the anti-aging compound,

146
00:08:00,320 --> 00:08:02,520
and it turns into a deadly poison.

147
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,000
Yuqing.

148
00:08:07,690 --> 00:08:09,140
If you would just

149
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,920
handed me the formula in the first place,

150
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,920
none of this would've happened.

151
00:08:24,950 --> 00:08:26,390
But maybe it's for the best.

152
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:28,140
What you gave me is more than enough

153
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:30,140
to take back the entire Wen Group.

154
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,900
Just wait a little longer.

155
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:38,140
Our time is coming.

156
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:41,840
Don't rush.

157
00:08:44,650 --> 00:08:45,650
Okay, Godfather.

158
00:08:51,900 --> 00:08:52,850
What is this?

159
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:55,960
This is the patented compound
my mom developed.

160
00:08:56,730 --> 00:08:57,930
When she was younger,

161
00:08:58,170 --> 00:09:00,350
she was a researcher
specializing in anti-aging drugs.

162
00:09:00,350 --> 00:09:02,840
Shortly before she died,
she resumed her research.

163
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,200
Just as she was making
a major breakthrough,

164
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,330
a shell company beat her to the patent.

165
00:09:07,490 --> 00:09:09,260
And behind this shell company

166
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,680
was He Mu.

167
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,240
He beat her to the patent?

168
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:17,320
Could it be that he killed your mother

169
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:19,470
to steal this patent?

170
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:20,730
I don't know,

171
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,540
but it's highly possible.

172
00:09:23,310 --> 00:09:27,670
After all,
he said the culprit was Wen Yanhui.

173
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,870
Is it possible that

174
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:31,250
he just wanted to pin everything

175
00:09:31,250 --> 00:09:32,610
on Wen Yanhui?

176
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,700
After all, he wants us to
suspect Wen Yanhui.

177
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:38,790
That way,
we'd be doing the dirty work for him

178
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:41,200
and taking out the biggest obstacle
to his rise to power.

179
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,860
No wonder we couldn't find any

180
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,810
connection between my mom and Wen Yanhui.

181
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,020
He Mu is best at manipulating people.

182
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:51,270
Otherwise, my mom wouldn't have
given up her career

183
00:09:51,270 --> 00:09:52,670
to raise me on her own.

184
00:09:52,890 --> 00:09:54,560
Even in the hardest times,

185
00:09:55,340 --> 00:09:56,670
she refused to go to him.

186
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:58,240
Until one day,

187
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:01,420
she decided to start living
for herself again.

188
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:02,950
She restarted this project

189
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:05,990
and brought out the patent
she'd kept for over a decade.

190
00:10:05,990 --> 00:10:06,990
But He Mu

191
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:09,780
discovered the huge profits involved.

192
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,720
He would rather let my mom die

193
00:10:11,810 --> 00:10:14,260
than let her be an independent person.

194
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,370
So...

195
00:10:27,710 --> 00:10:29,550
he not only killed your mother,

196
00:10:31,150 --> 00:10:33,750
but also stole a patent worth a fortune.
